{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Next Stop",
    "steam_appid": 3795470,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/771ee793c205ad02cc6e0fb425cc0843.avif?t=1753185569\" width=700 height=127 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/02b2d36e2051d7e6fff246b7d37406b3.poster.avif?t=1753185569\" width=800 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/02b2d36e2051d7e6fff246b7d37406b3.webm?t=1753185569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>The Next Stop </strong>is a narrative adventure about a murder full of contradictions, where the clues don't add up and everything hides something darker. It blends <strong>point &amp; click</strong> mechanics with the depth of a <strong>visual novel</strong>, all set in a haunting subway filled with secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight people are on board. Eight stories. Eight <strong>hidden truths</strong>. Each stop on the train reveals a new chapter. Each carriage is a different experience. Every <strong>decision </strong>you make has consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/767e8138f05ad3829e82034cc5420691.avif?t=1753185569\" data-has-big width=800 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Examine </strong>objects, find hidden messages and connect environmental elements to move freely through the wagon. <strong>Attention to detail</strong> is key to progress and uncover the puzzles.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/65fbda37b7b80ceb26e9252f1936d1d8.poster.avif?t=1753185569\" width=800 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/65fbda37b7b80ceb26e9252f1936d1d8.webm?t=1753185569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/a3ce9f71d849a395562d75f956f4fd29.avif?t=1753185569\" data-has-big width=800 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact </strong>with every passenger in conversations where your decisions matter. Lie or tell the truth. Show empathy or keep your distance. Your <strong>actions </strong>will have <strong>consequences</strong>.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/ab967d7894500904cc492c23cecf7897.poster.avif?t=1753185569\" width=800 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/ab967d7894500904cc492c23cecf7897.webm?t=1753185569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/99e86cb2f7c1ea0db04182bd0c012515.avif?t=1753185569\" data-has-big width=800 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles</strong> through point and click mechanics. From coins that activate signs to walkmans with <strong>hidden clues</strong>, each element has a purpose.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/96250896a90a224abb3cdea48218834e.poster.avif?t=1753185569\" width=800 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/96250896a90a224abb3cdea48218834e.webm?t=1753185569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/1742ef4dda3ebdfb8d001fa1ff9e59bb.avif?t=1753185569\" data-has-big width=800 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone is <strong>following you</strong> closely. Every decision you make, every word you choose... <strong>you are not alone </strong>on this journey.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/903002511a6315cfea4c9e8f361041cd.poster.avif?t=1753185569\" width=800 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/903002511a6315cfea4c9e8f361041cd.webm?t=1753185569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/a5e14738ddf40c417cd8315388a0487a.avif?t=1753185569\" width=700 height=127 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will discover the <strong>hidden stories</strong> of underground passengers, each with their own secrets, fears and truths to reveal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will step into the shoes of <strong>Kane</strong>, a man caught between what he remembers and what he fears, on a journey full of important decisions, riddles and unsettling encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you travel this mysterious underground journey, you will also meet <strong>Ray</strong>,<strong> Phoebe</strong> and <strong>other characters</strong> who, little by little, will show you that this <strong>journey </strong>is much more disturbing than it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because in <strong>The Next Stop</strong>, the underground doesn't just take you somewhere else... it also takes you to the depths of your consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/c5b25f2f5c01ef2e487f5d902b3977f5.poster.avif?t=1753185569\" width=800 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/c5b25f2f5c01ef2e487f5d902b3977f5.webm?t=1753185569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/771ee793c205ad02cc6e0fb425cc0843.avif?t=1753185569\" width=700 height=127 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/02b2d36e2051d7e6fff246b7d37406b3.poster.avif?t=1753185569\" width=800 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/02b2d36e2051d7e6fff246b7d37406b3.webm?t=1753185569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>The Next Stop </strong>is a narrative adventure about a murder full of contradictions, where the clues don't add up and everything hides something darker. It blends <strong>point &amp; click</strong> mechanics with the depth of a <strong>visual novel</strong>, all set in a haunting subway filled with secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight people are on board. Eight stories. Eight <strong>hidden truths</strong>. Each stop on the train reveals a new chapter. Each carriage is a different experience. Every <strong>decision </strong>you make has consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/767e8138f05ad3829e82034cc5420691.avif?t=1753185569\" data-has-big width=800 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Examine </strong>objects, find hidden messages and connect environmental elements to move freely through the wagon. <strong>Attention to detail</strong> is key to progress and uncover the puzzles.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/65fbda37b7b80ceb26e9252f1936d1d8.poster.avif?t=1753185569\" width=800 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/65fbda37b7b80ceb26e9252f1936d1d8.webm?t=1753185569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/a3ce9f71d849a395562d75f956f4fd29.avif?t=1753185569\" data-has-big width=800 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact </strong>with every passenger in conversations where your decisions matter. Lie or tell the truth. Show empathy or keep your distance. Your <strong>actions </strong>will have <strong>consequences</strong>.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/ab967d7894500904cc492c23cecf7897.poster.avif?t=1753185569\" width=800 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/ab967d7894500904cc492c23cecf7897.webm?t=1753185569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/99e86cb2f7c1ea0db04182bd0c012515.avif?t=1753185569\" data-has-big width=800 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles</strong> through point and click mechanics. From coins that activate signs to walkmans with <strong>hidden clues</strong>, each element has a purpose.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/96250896a90a224abb3cdea48218834e.poster.avif?t=1753185569\" width=800 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/96250896a90a224abb3cdea48218834e.webm?t=1753185569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/1742ef4dda3ebdfb8d001fa1ff9e59bb.avif?t=1753185569\" data-has-big width=800 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone is <strong>following you</strong> closely. Every decision you make, every word you choose... <strong>you are not alone </strong>on this journey.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/903002511a6315cfea4c9e8f361041cd.poster.avif?t=1753185569\" width=800 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/903002511a6315cfea4c9e8f361041cd.webm?t=1753185569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/a5e14738ddf40c417cd8315388a0487a.avif?t=1753185569\" width=700 height=127 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will discover the <strong>hidden stories</strong> of underground passengers, each with their own secrets, fears and truths to reveal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will step into the shoes of <strong>Kane</strong>, a man caught between what he remembers and what he fears, on a journey full of important decisions, riddles and unsettling encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you travel this mysterious underground journey, you will also meet <strong>Ray</strong>,<strong> Phoebe</strong> and <strong>other characters</strong> who, little by little, will show you that this <strong>journey </strong>is much more disturbing than it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because in <strong>The Next Stop</strong>, the underground doesn't just take you somewhere else... it also takes you to the depths of your consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/c5b25f2f5c01ef2e487f5d902b3977f5.poster.avif?t=1753185569\" width=800 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795470/extras/c5b25f2f5c01ef2e487f5d902b3977f5.webm?t=1753185569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
